    {
      "id": "sol.ahsme-1995-p10.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The vertices are \\((0,0),\\) \\((6,6),\\) and \\((-6,6).\\) The horizontal base has length \\(12,\\) and the height is \\(6,\\) so the area is \\(\\frac12(12)(6)=36.\\) Thus the correct answer is E.",
